    "source_book_raw": "Heroes from the Fringe pg. 20",
    "definition_raw": "Source Heroes from the Fringe pg. 20\nHalf-drow tap into inner reserves, fighting even more fiercely when losing.\n\nPrerequisites: Base attack bonus +1, darkborn half-elf.\n\nBenefit: When reduced to half of your maximum hit points or fewer, you gain a +1 morale bonus on attack and damage rolls. This bonus increases to +2 at 8th level and to +3 at 15th level.",
